From 2fd17b2baf47751be7732d95a84932cb81432cac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mark Chandler <admin@lodle.net>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:19:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] SourceSharp: trim game/client headers to the native
 remainder

c_baseentity.h, c_world.h, c_baseplayer.h, tempent.h, c_rope.h and the other
client headers reduced to the members the native client.so still uses, with
the interfaces it gains (the world's ICollideable member, ...); the rest of
each class lives in managed code.
